    "sections": {
        "description": "STLogistic is a modern, lightweight, and fully responsive WordPress theme developed for logistics companies, transportation services, cargo, delivery company, moving company, shipment, shipping company, transport company, freight transport, logistic warehouse, trucking, freight agencies, warehouse businesses, and supply chain providers. Built with clean code and optimized for performance, the theme ensures a smooth and reliable browsing experience across all devices. The theme includes customizable sections and blog support, making it easy to create a professional logistics website that effectively showcases your services. STLogistic is compatible with popular page builders and supports WooCommerce, making it a great choice for shipment services, transport bookings, and logistics management solutions. Whether you operate a logistics company, cargo service, or supply chain business, STLogistic offers a stylish, flexible, and professional foundation for building a strong online presence."
    },
